1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,590
Give me a break.

25
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:51,750
Scram !

26
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:54,470
Ceng Niu !?

27
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,590
You're still alive !?

28
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,990
Ceng Niu ?

29
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:06,750
Why does he have such an overbearing aura ?

30
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,470
This aura

31
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:11,630
is something only ancient cultivators could possess.

32
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,630
No...

33
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,190
You're not him !

34
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,830
Who the hell are you ?!

35
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,990
I'm asking you,

36
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:22,750
which generation Suzaku are you ?

37
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,950
The 14th generation Suzaku.

38
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,990
On the behalf of Ye Wuyou,

39
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,630
this old man won't kill you today.

40
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:31,550
Now scram !

41
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,400
You...

42
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,470
How do you know the name of the first Suzaku ?

43
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,590
Ye Wuyou ?

44
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,510
Only Suzaku successors

45
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:43,870
know that name.

46
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:46,470
An outsiders couldn't possibly know...

47
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,790
His attitude is so overbearing...

48
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,990
Could he be !?

49
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:57,230
Greetings, Ancestor.

50
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,870
Junior is leaving.

51
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,990
Leave the 4th soul !

52
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,990
Forget it,

53
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:09,310
you need the 4th soul against the Forsaken Immortal Clan.

54
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:12,150
Ye Wuyou once saved me

55
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,350
so I'll lend it for 3 years.

56
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,390
Thank you, Ancestor.

57
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,320
But...

58
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,630
However...

59
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,550
Since you guessed my identity,

60
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:32,230
then you must know my rules.

61
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:33,630
Are you

62
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:35,750
just leaving like this !?

63
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,350
Junior was negligent.

64
00:03:42,640 --> 00:03:44,430
are 2 fingers enough ?

65
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,830
Leave another one.

66
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,790
Now scram.

67
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,310
Ceng Niu !

68
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,790
Possession ?!

69
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,430
Senior, stop !

70
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:44,150
Little brat, you were about to make a mistake.

71
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,950
If this old man had his old temper,

72
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:47,990
I would have killed you instantly !

73
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,630
Who said you could rain !?

74
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,800
Now scatter for me !

75
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:00,760
This...

76
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,790
What's going on ?

77
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:04,800
Why did you ask for the 4th soul !?

78
00:05:04,810 --> 00:05:06,840
If that brat had noticed something,

79
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,990
I would've had to go back to sleep just after waking up !

80
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:12,630
The 4th soul can wait until I get a new body

81
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,150
and restore my cultivation.

82
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:17,110
I'll storm Mount Suzaku and take it back !

83
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:20,030
May I ask who Senior is ?

84
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:21,830
Wang Lin,

85
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,910
can you tell that brat

86
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,430
who I am.

87
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,790
He's Situ Nan.

88
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,270
Situ Nan ?

89
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,150
2nd generation Suzaku.

90
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,550
No wonder the Suzaku fled...

91
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:41,320
Junior Du Tian of the Soul Refining Sect

92
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,950
greets Senior.

93
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,550
During the previous war,

94
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,870
your 4th ancestor helped us.

95
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,270
Since you helped Wang Lin to reach Soul Transformation

96
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,750
and wake me up,

97
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,030
Little brat,

98
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:55,240
although your lifespan is ending,

99
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,430
I promise you

100
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:58,440
that when I recover my cultivation,

101
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:01,190
I'll reclaim your 4th ancestor's soul

102
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:04,550
and restore the Soul Refining Sect.

103
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:06,950
Senior Brother,

104
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:10,150
your prediction worked...

105
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:13,000
The clouds and the mist cannot hide a thousand mountains.

106
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,990
I will not become a sinner of our sect.

107
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:18,560
This wish has remained unchanged for thousands of years.

108
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:17,350
I can face you with pride now,

109
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,350
and our master,

110
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:23,160
The Dao can be condensed into a single thought.

111
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:23,070
and all of the Ancestors.

112
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:29,320
The past flashes before my eyes

113
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:29,320
as I turn around to let it go.

114
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,280
Little friend Ceng Niu,

115
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:30,830
this old man has one last request.

116
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:35,690
Resolutely carrying the torch forward.

117
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,750
I will condense my memory

118
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,750
inside the Soul Flag.

119
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,750
Keep it safe for me

120
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,150
and let future disciples see

121
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:41,160
Even though the cycle of reincarnation is endless,

122
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:46,000
I have no regrets in my heart.

123
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:47,150
how glorious our Soul Refining Sect once was.

124
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:51,480
Only when facing death

125
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:51,480
does one realize they have no regrets.

126
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:57,480
I will fulfill your wish,\NI will rush forward through dust and smoke to chase the light.

127
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:02,840
Even if the road is difficult,\NI will give it my heart and soul.

128
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,550
Father !

129
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,110
Mother !

130
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,960
Du Tian\NKid

131
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:08,720
Behind you, countless clear eyes\Nlook at the world you made.

132
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:14,440
You soul will not die,\Nit will live forever.

133
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:15,910
Kid,

134
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:18,550
are you willing to come with me ?

135
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,880
Yun Yimo\NFormer Soul Refining Sect Leader\NLate stage Soul Transformation

136
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:33,160
Du Tian\NAdult

137
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:42,990
I, Du Tian,

138
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:45,440
swear to devote this life

139
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,990
to protecting our sect !

140
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:45,880
I will dare to rely on the Billion-Soul Flag

141
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:45,880
to face the wind and stirr up a storm.

142
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:50,960
I'm betting on how dazzling\Nthis single spark can become.

143
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:57,080
I have witnessed the vicissitudes of life

144
00:07:53,140 --> 00:07:57,080
and travelled through this long night but I remain untainted.

145
00:07:57,240 --> 00:08:02,760
The promise I once broke

146
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:02,760
was just reignited.

147
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,150
Master...

148
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,670
Master,

149
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:08,430
I've fulfilled my promise.

150
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:08,960
I hold in my heart

151
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:08,960
your wish to see your past glory once more.

152
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,150
Kid,

153
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:14,680
There will always be someone

154
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:14,680
to see the world you protected.

155
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,230
are you willing to come with me ?

156
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:20,080
Even if it takes countless lifetimes.

157
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:25,600
Seeing mountains and rivers is like meeting people.

158
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:30,440
Let me carry on all the wishes

159
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:31,390
I, Du Tian,

160
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:34,080
will now wipe my consciousness

161
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:35,280
that you couldn't fulfill.

162
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:36,350
and become a soul fragment of the Soul Flag !

163
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,430
Master...

164
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,190
disciple...

165
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:43,790
is coming.

166
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,440
Senior, rest assured.

167
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,830
I will fulfill my promise

168
00:08:58,640 --> 00:09:00,230
to the Soul Refining Sect.

169
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,000
North of the\NSuzaku Continent

170
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,800
We must attack

171
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,310
and destroy this Reincarnation Tree !

172
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:29,510
At least the Suzaku

173
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:31,840
Fourth Ancestor of the\NForsaken Immortal Clan\N9-Leaf Shaman

174
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:32,830
was able to fight me.

175
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:34,350
But you

176
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:37,350
are merely Early stage Ascendant !

177
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:51,040
The battle has already started.

178
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:53,790
This tree was nurtured by Ancestral Spirits.

179
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,550
I remember that Ye Wuyou

180
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:57,590
studied a technique

181
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,790
to absorb their power

182
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,590
to increase your cultivation.

183
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:06,750
I like this northern one.

184
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:07,920
Senior !

185
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:09,240
What are you doing !?

186
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,950
Do you really think

187
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:25,510
that the Forsaken Immortal Clan wouldn't be prepared ?

188
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,590
Forsaken Immortal Clan,

189
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:28,990
formation !

190
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,350
Formation,

191
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:31,670
activate !

192
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:42,640
Retreat !

193
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,960
Are you trying to leave now ?

194
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,230
It's too late !

195
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,520
Fight to the death !

196
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,750
Fight !

197
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,790
What's wrong ?

198
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:12,270
What happened ?

199
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:13,630
It stopped ?

200
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,190
This tastes awful !

201
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,230
Our Ancestral Spirit cultivated for thousands of years

202
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,070
and you ate it !

203
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,710
You bastard !

204
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,950
I'll kill you !

205
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,190
Don't just stand there,

206
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,230
hurry up !

207
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,070
Retreat !

208
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,030
Quick !

209
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:41,710
Go !

210
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,270
Brat, I'm here !

211
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:46,710
Catch me if you can !

212
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,670
Stay right there !

213
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,710
Devouring Ancestral Spirits restores cultivation

214
00:12:13,050 --> 00:12:14,960
and eliminates the Warriors

215
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,310
the Forsaken Immortal Clan were incubating.

216
00:12:18,160 --> 00:12:20,350
A worthy tribute to the first Suzaku !

217
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,800
What will you do now ?

218
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:26,750
I'll find a body that matches my Spirit Root.

219
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,150
Once I'm back at my prime,

220
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,990
I'll hunt down those people one by one !

221
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:34,630
And if they're dead,

222
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,760
their descendants will pay for their crimes !

223
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,150
Senior,

224
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:44,110
I know the Heaven Defying Bead

225
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:45,750
is a heavenly artifact

226
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:47,630
that surpasses even celestial artifacts.

227
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:50,270
Since it has fused with my soul

228
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:53,070
I don't know if I can return it to you.

229
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:54,350
Nonsense !

230
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,030
That damned bead ruined me,

231
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,350
I don't want it.

232
00:12:58,880 --> 00:12:59,950
You can keep it.

233
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,350
Situ...

234
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:04,830
What ?

235
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:06,950
Thank you.

236
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:10,830
Wh..

237
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:13,150
Why are you so sentimental ?

238
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,430
Since I watched you grow,

239
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:17,270
you're like my disciple.

240
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:19,070
It's just a stupid bead,

241
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,830
you don't need to say that.

242
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,350
It makes me sick.

243
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:26,040
What's so funny !?

244
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:28,790
If you want to thank me

245
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:30,790
then find me a suitable body.

246
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:35,270
The Suzaku has a disciple named Qian Feng.

247
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,840
His body might do the trick.

248
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,950
The Suzaku's disciple...

249
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:41,910
Nevermind,

250
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:44,230
since the first Suzaku helped me,

251
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,750
I'll find another.

252
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,150
Interesting...

253
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:56,750
How can such a body exist ?

254
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,670
Once possessed,

255
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,550
it will match its Spirit Root.

256
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,080
It's a body made to be possessed.

257
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,120
It's this one !

258
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,280
Little Lin,

259
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:11,750
let's lure him to the Northern Flame Plains.

260
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,390
Little Tattoo kid,

261
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,190
grandpa is here !

262
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:22,720
Northern Flame Plains

263
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,390
Little Tattoo kid,

264
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:28,190
How many times did I have to stop to wait for you ?

265
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,510
You must hurry up !

266
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,750
His repeated provocations

267
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:34,950
are suspicious...

268
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:37,470
But if he hasn't refined the spirit

269
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,910
I can still reclaim it !

270
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:47,360
It's him !

271
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,350
Is this...

272
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,550
a restriction ?

273
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:03,230
The Nine-Li Fog

274
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:05,350
is a natural formation.

275
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,120
Little Lin,

276
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,670
you will use it

277
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,990
to trap that Ascendant brat.

278
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,950
Extreme Flame Blood Light ?

279
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,950
this light causes any creature with blood

280
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:37,750
to burn, boil and die

281
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:40,830
within 10 breaths !

282
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,870
Pathetic tricks !

283
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:56,350
Give me the Ancestral Spirit !

284
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:02,230
You dare to possess me !?

285
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,270
Get out !

286
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,270
Do it now !

287
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:16,070
Seal !

288
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,350
Well done.

289
00:16:20,560 --> 00:16:22,950
With this demon child's body, an Ascendant cultivator

290
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:25,150
and the Ancestral Spirit

291
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,590
it won't take long

292
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,630
for me to fully recover.

293
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:31,150
I'll come and find you then.

294
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,670
You don't need me to guard you ?

295
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:33,880
You don't need to.

296
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:36,550
The Nine-Li Fog will protect me.

297
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,120
By the way,

298
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:40,110
I've been meaning to ask you.

299
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:43,550
I've never heard of a Ji Realm cultivator above Nascent Soul

300
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:45,790
but you somehow are Soul Transformation.

301
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:47,840
How did you do it ?

302
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:50,160
I extracted the Ji Realm.

303
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,550
Resisting its temptation

304
00:16:55,560 --> 00:16:57,030
and extracting it

305
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:59,150
is remarkable.

306
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,480
However,

307
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,510
I've heard there is another method.

308
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:05,670
If you obtain and refine

309
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,670
a Cultivation Planet Crystal

310
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:09,440
you can breakthrough that Ji Realm bottleneck.

311
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:14,790
I'm not sure if it can help Ji Realm cultivators

312
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,670
to breakthrough.

313
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,190
But if you want to leave planet Suzaku

314
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:21,390
you will need it anyways.

315
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,550
What do you mean ?

316
00:17:23,360 --> 00:17:24,950
Before I became the Suzaku

317
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,630
I thought it was a powerful artifact.

318
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:28,470
But then, I learned that

319
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,950
it is how rank 6 cultivation countries

320
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:33,790
control their planet.

321
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:38,990
The Cultivation Alliance creates these crystals

322
00:17:39,680 --> 00:17:41,750
and when a country reaches rank 6

323
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:44,470
they're given a planet

324
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,990
and a Cultivation Planet Crystal.

325
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:49,270
Once it's activated,

326
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:52,030
all lifeforms born on that planet

327
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:55,590
will have a strand of their soul stolen by the crystal.

328
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:59,550
There is an item called the Cultivation Planet Heart.

329
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:02,750
It's held by the successive generations of Suzakus.

330
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:05,070
By using a bit of lifespan,

331
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:08,270
they can kill anyone whose soul strand is inside it.

332
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:11,230
During your Ascendant breakthrough,

333
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:13,430
you can extract it.

334
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:15,830
There is no way around it.

335
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:19,190
When I learned of this,

336
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:22,390
I secretly sealed our Cultivation Planet Crystal.

337
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:25,430
Although it still absorbs soul strands,

338
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:27,190
the seal prevents

339
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:29,350
anyone from controlling it.

340
00:18:29,600 --> 00:18:33,350
This is why planet Suzaku is in such a mess.

341
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:36,550
If Zhuque Zi breaks the seal,

342
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,350
it will be a disaster.

343
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:41,670
Enough,

344
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:44,550
let's talk about it once I recover.

345
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:46,640
You don’t need to worry too much,

346
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:47,630
I’m still here.

347
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:58,070
Cultivation Planet Crystal...

348
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,430
I, Wang Lin,

349
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:03,590
will never leave my life in someone's hands.

350
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:06,000
As for Wan'er's soul strand...

351
00:19:06,360 --> 00:19:08,430
I need to recover it too !

352
00:19:30,110 --> 00:19:33,410
To let go of the consequences of my actions

353
00:19:33,410 --> 00:19:35,130
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

354
00:19:35,170 --> 00:19:37,070
like scattered ink.

355
00:19:37,950 --> 00:19:44,550
As destiny falls

356
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:44,550
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

357
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:52,150
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

358
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:52,150
wither and melt into rivers.

359
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:59,710
Who can deceive

360
00:19:55,350 --> 00:19:59,710
the law of the heavens ?

361
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:03,030
Countless generations

362
00:20:01,310 --> 00:20:03,030
have tried before me.

363
00:20:03,320 --> 00:20:06,750
But how could I not catch my dreams

364
00:20:05,150 --> 00:20:06,750
within my warm fingers ?

365
00:20:07,310 --> 00:20:10,830
You're at my side when I'm alone

366
00:20:10,830 --> 00:20:14,150
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

367
00:20:14,910 --> 00:20:18,110
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

368
00:20:18,470 --> 00:20:22,310
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

369
00:20:20,310 --> 00:20:22,310
in the streets.

370
00:20:22,470 --> 00:20:27,270
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

371
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:27,270
Can I break the rules ?

372
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:29,990
To run towards you !

373
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:33,310
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

374
00:20:33,310 --> 00:20:37,950
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

375
00:20:37,950 --> 00:20:41,350
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

376
00:20:41,390 --> 00:20:46,030
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

377
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:51,710
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

378
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:55,630
If your soul is willing to wander,

379
00:20:55,630 --> 00:21:00,270
can I still take your hands

380
00:20:57,310 --> 00:21:00,270
and hold them tight ?

381
00:21:00,430 --> 00:21:03,350
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

382
00:21:03,350 --> 00:21:08,230
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

383
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:11,510
I dream of destroying

384
00:21:11,670 --> 00:21:16,230
the shackles of our fate.

385
00:21:16,230 --> 00:21:20,190
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

386
00:21:20,190 --> 00:21:22,990
You're the hardest to let go of.

387
00:21:23,070 --> 00:21:26,870
I want to be with you again

388
00:21:26,950 --> 00:21:30,230
so I can look in your eyes.

389
00:21:30,510 --> 00:21:35,470
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
